ected_piece","cutout_rule":"bbox_of_frame_in_box_plus_2_margin","delta_min_au":0.05,"detect_formula":"peak = unmasked pixel with I - B > k_detect * sqrt(VARIANCE) that is the maximum of its peak box; B = bilinear mesh of sigma-clipped box means; greedy minimum separation by (-D, row, column), on the peaks and again on the centroids","exposure_tol_s":1.0,"fixed_formula":"a dot that is not star with a dot of another visit within r_match at the same RA/Dec, where that visit's coverage holds it","glitch_formula":"a dot is kept when it has a counterpart within r_match + rate_max * |dt| (px) in at least k_visit - 1 other frames of its visit, both detectors counting; r_match = max(r_match_min_px, r_match_sigma * sigma_c) of the larger of the two dots; k_visit = min(k_visit_max, frames of the visit whose cutout holds the dot at least coverage_erode_px inside its edge)","grid_step_deg":0.25,"hardware_flags":"TRANSIENT,OVERFLOW,SUR_ERROR,PHANTOM,REFERENCE,NONFUNC,DICHROIC,MISSING_DATA,HOT,COLD,FULLSAMPLE,PHANMISS,NONLINEAR,PERSIST","inputs":"recorded_eros_fixture","k_detect":5.0,"k_visit_max":3,"known_formula":"SkyBoT cone per visit (area half-diagonal + rate_max * visit span / 2 + p_max), V <= v_lim; Horizons TLIST from 500@-163182 at every exposure time; a track matches when at least known_min_frac of its dots lie within max(r_known_min_px, 3 sigma_c + ephemeris 3 sigma)","known_min_frac":0.666667,"linker":"pairs","margin_deg":0.02,"measure_method_sha":"ee37fa9c0d73f8f12ea154cd080f882b8e140ac87074893034111359ffc14e5f","measure_version":"measure-1","min_motion_px":1.0,"min_sep_px":3.0,"overlap_eps_deg2":1e-12,"p_max_arcsec":60.0,"pair_formula":"rate window rate_min = r_match_min_px / dt_v to rate_max = min(rate_max_deg_day, (diagonal - 2 margin) / dt_v); v_in = v_AB - w u with w the SPHEREx velocity about the geocentre projected on the sky at the area centre (Horizons VECTORS, one per visit); u >= 0 fitted by least squares; residual = largest |v_in - v_AB + w u| perpendicular to w; pass when residual <= max(v_tol_min, v_tol_sigma * sigma_v) and u <= 1/delta_min; track when mutual best and best <= ambiguity_ratio * next","pair_test":"parallax","peak_box_px":3,"r_known_min_px":3.0,"r_match_min_px":2.0,"r_match_sigma":3.0,"rate_max_deg_day":1.2,"rms_max_px":1.0,"stamp_half_px":11,"star_artefact_flags":"BLOOM,HALO","star_cones":"track:1,track:2","star_formula":"a tracklet is star when every dot lies within max(r_match, r_px) of the same Gaia DR3 or CatWISE2020 source of the visit's star list, propagated to the dot time (r_px: the A19.6 mask radius); a dot whose flags hold a star_artefact_flags name is star too","tracklet_formula":"per visit, greedy best-first over seed pairs within the glitch radius: the line through the pair predicts each frame, the nearest unused dot within r_match joins; least-squares line x(t), y(t) on the area plane; kept when rms <= rms_max_px and the dots span 2 or more times; best = most dots, then smallest rms, then the earliest dot; sigma_v from the fit residuals","v_lim":22.0,"v_tol_min_deg_day":0.1,"v_tol_sigma":3.0,"visit_gap_h":1.0}},"missing":["checks:not_run","cutout:2026W12_2A_0340_1_D1","cutout:2026W12_2A_0340_1_D4","rate_grid:visits"],"n_frames":18,"n_visits":2,"provenance":{"coverage":{"formula":"per visit: 30 arcsec cells on the gnomonic plane of the area; a cell is covered when its centre is inside the area box, at least coverage_erode_px inside the s_region of a frame of the visit that has a cutout, and at least coverage_erode_px inside that cutout's pixels; the largest 4-connected piece is kept (ties: lowest cell index); polygon = its outline","source":"IRSA SPHEREx QR2 cutouts: PR #53's recorded 0.1 deg cutouts centred on Eros stand in for the area's own, so coverage is limited to them (Q-402 (3))","tag":"derived"},"frames":{"source":"IRSA SIA, SPHEREx QR2 frame list: PR #53's two recorded Eros path cones stand in for the area's cone grid (Q-400 (13))","tag":"measured"},"steps":{"formula":"labels counted in /dots, statuses and verdicts counted in /tracks (A17.3 to A17.5)","source":"counts of the area's dots and tracks","tag":"derived"}},"ra":91.23046,"steps":{"n_dots":456,"n_fixed":0,"n_found_blind":1,"n_glitches":12,"n_possible":8,"n_stars":392,"n_static_one_visit":0,"n_tracks":1,"n_unchecked":0,"n_unexplained":0},"width_deg":1.05}